<title>HONG KONG: Cross-Harbour declares third dividend.</title>
<headline>Cross-Harbour declares third dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in H.K. cents unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend		     27.0 vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cross-Harbour Tunnel Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Dec 28, 1996 to Jan 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Jan 8, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Cross-Harbour Tunnel, owned 26.7 percent by Wharf (Holdings) Ltd, operates a road tunnel between Hong Kong island and the Kowloon Peninsula.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
